Output ../gifs/ImportDemo.gif

Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set FontSize 30

Hide
Sleep 0.5s
Show

Type 'Using the local path to import a book:'
Ctrl+C
Type 'ctread import ~/Desktop/go/TestBook.epub'
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type 'Listing the registry:'
Ctrl+C
Type 'ctread registry'
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 1s
